# ui/edD (id 187): edit-mode echo. Editing E = (L4 >= 1 typed units) AND (L5 = 0, not Go To).
# PC 0: not editing, or the active row is below the visible rows (r >= 28: e2 = [1000 L5 + r >= 28]) -> fbA (159). Editing: write UI_EDLEN (0x44) = L4.
# PC 1: write -1 to the display-cache TAG of the active cell (forces its row to repaint after
#       the entry ends; the commit moves HEAP_TOP, so the gate scans). PC 2 is unused.
# PC 3: read 0x44 and enter the heap copy at hc1 (134) with T0 = HS (L9), P0 = BUF: the typed
#       units (packed at HS + 2.., kernel commit.md) are unpacked into BUF; returns to PC 4.
# PC 4: fill the active cell interior white. PC 5: aligned text (138), left, black on white,
#       X 32 + 64c, top 201 + 20r, clip min(92 + 64c, 1278), then on to fbA (159).
# PC 7 (from fbE while editing): as PC 3, returning to PC 8. PC 8: aligned text in the formula
#       box (X 163, top 156, clip 1272), returning to (L22, L23).
# Note: weights/ui/fbar.md.  M = 2^22
